  "boundary": "Exact current validator dispatch and registered type join establish BuffValidator identity. Member2 consumes BuffFindSettings followed by a required DWORD; its ValidateMode scalar context adds no serialized header. BuffFindSettings reuses the independently pinned B4 reader: FF or header3 with nullable signed payload list, DWORD and query; query has its own nullable counted DWORD list. All counts and lengths are bounded before use. Null settings do not remove the terminal DWORD. Complete formatter, initialization/normal, table dispatch and cold rejoin windows retain whole instructions. Structural-only framing does not establish buff ownership, validation behavior, live formatter choice, full refill/error parity or whole-BuffData EOF.",
